    "html": "<div class=\"fun-rocket\" role=\"status\" aria-label=\"Launching rocket\">\n  <div class=\"fun-rocket-ship\">🚀</div>\n  <div class=\"fun-rocket-flame\"></div>\n  <div class=\"fun-rocket-smoke\">\n    <div class=\"fun-rocket-puff\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fun-rocket-puff\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
